# Tables for a two-subgroup of the third Held centralizer candidate

The 128 rows are permutations on the same sixteen points as the shared
`Third` carrier. Multiplication, inverses, and words in its two specified
generators are recorded here. The companion certification module checks these
tables in the Lean kernel; this data module asserts no group calculation.

The tables were generated by ordinary permutation composition, independently
of any SmallGroups identifier. See `source/generate.py` for regeneration.
Source of the exclusion problem: Huppert--Blackburn III, XII.1.18(b), p.314.
-/

